{"id":"profit","lemma":"profit","pos":"noun","rank":3000,"glosses":["profit, benefit"],"ipa":"/pʁɔ.fi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/15/Fr-profit.ogg/Fr-profit.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"profits"},"formAudio":{"profits":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c4/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-profits.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Essaie de tirer profit de chaque occasion.","en":"Try to make the most of every opportunity.","words":[{"g":"to test, to try on","l":"essayer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to draw, drag, pull"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"each"},{"g":"occasion, opportunity"}]},{"text":"Partageons les profits.","en":"Let's split the profits.","words":[{"g":"to share","l":"partager"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Il met à profit ses opportunités.","en":"He makes the most of his opportunities.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"to / at"},null,{"g":"his"},{"g":"a state of opportuneness","l":"opportunité"}]},{"text":"Nous partageâmes les profits entre nous tous.","en":"We shared the profit among us all.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to share","l":"partager"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,null,null,{"g":"all"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"between ourselves"]]},{"text":"Un homme sage tire profit de ses erreurs.","en":"A wise man profits from his mistakes.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"man"},{"g":"wise: prudent"},{"g":"to draw, drag, pull","l":"tirer"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"error","l":"erreur"}]}]}